sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student
    participant UI as React Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI ChatRouter
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database
    participant VS as VectorstorePostgres
    participant LLM as Groq API Llama 3.3 70B

    Student->>UI: Types question in AI chat box
    UI->>API: POST /chat/{chatbot_id} with JWT cookie

    API->>DB: Verify JWT and check student enrollment
    DB-->>API: Student authorised for this chatbot

    Note over API,VS: Retrieval Phase - Hybrid Search
    API->>VS: hybrid_search(query, top_k=5)
    VS->>VS: Calculate BM25 scores for all chunks
    VS->>VS: Generate 384-dim query embedding
    VS->>VS: Calculate cosine similarity via pgvector HNSW
    VS->>VS: Hybrid score = 0.4 x BM25 + 0.6 x semantic
    VS-->>API: Return Top 5 chunks with chapter and page metadata

    Note over API,LLM: Generation Phase - Prompt and Stream
    API->>API: Construct prompt with system rules plus chunks plus query
    API->>LLM: POST streaming request temperature 0.1 max_tokens 1024
    
    loop SSE Token Stream
        LLM-->>API: Individual token
        API-->>UI: Server-Sent Event with token
        UI-->>Student: Render token in real time with typing effect
    end

    LLM-->>API: Stream complete
    API->>DB: Log interaction for analytics
    UI-->>Student: Display final response with source citations
